B.qR=new A.bg(B.r_,["Waking up","Sound on","Sound off","Tap anywhere for sound","Skip intro","Sonot \u2014 Launch film",B.EK,"Think in *light.*","Ask anything","Plan 3 days in Kyoto under $800",B.EX,"Total $742 \xb7 $58 to spare","It reasons","Thinks *before* it speaks.",B.F7,"It builds","Code that *runs.*","42 passed \xb7 0 failed","It sees","Understands what it *sees.*",B.Fq,"Bright, tidy workspace. Raise the laptop ~8 cm and your neck will thank you.",B.Fm,"Every question deserves a *brilliant* answer.","On every screen *you own.*","Made by ThatMaxwell","Free on macOS \xb7 Windows \xb7 Linux \xb7 iOS \xb7 Android",B.Ew,"Download","Sonot 1.0 is here","Think","in *light.*","The AI that reads, reasons, writes, codes, sees and speaks \u2014 beautifully, on every screen you own.","Download for {os}","Watch the film","Free \xb7 macOS \xb7 Windows \xb7 Linux \xb7 iOS \xb7 Android","Scroll",B.Fe,B.FC,"Sonot reads, reasons, writes, codes, sees and speaks. It remembers what matters, forgets what you ask it to, and never makes you wait. It's the assistant Maxwell always wanted \u2014 so he built it.",B.Fo,"Desktop app","Your desktop, *now brilliant.*",B.Gd,"New chat","Search","Today","This week",B.F_,"Sonot Free","I've got 3 days in Kyoto in November and $800. Make it unforgettable \u2014 I love food, temples and long walks.","Thought for 4s","November is maple season, so I built this around the best foliage at the quietest hours. Everything is walkable or on one JR pass, with $58 to spare.",B.DO,B.Gh,"Ask Sonot anything\u2026","Make this message sound friendlier","Friendlier version","\u201cHey team! Quick heads-up: launch moves to Thursday so we can polish a few things. Thanks for rolling with it \u2014 you're the best.\u201d","Replace","Copy",B.DD,"Sun 4 Oct  9:41","Activities","iOS & Android","In your pocket. *Always on.*","Ask out loud on a walk, snap a photo of a menu, or get a heads-up before your day starts.","Sunday, October 4","now","Morning, Maxwell. Rain from 3pm \u2014 grab a jacket. Your 10:30 moved to 11, so there's time for coffee.","Spanish streak: day 12","Heater email","Help me tell my landlord the heater's broken again. Firm but polite?","Here's a draft:","Heater repair \u2014 second request","Hi Dana, the heater in 4B stopped working again on Oct 2. Could you schedule a repair by Friday? I'm happy to be home for it. Thanks!",B.FO,"Message","Listening","\u201cWhat should I name my golden retriever puppy?\u201d","Sunny, Maple or Biscuit \u2014 and if she's a little chaotic, Waffles.","Talents","One mind. *Every talent.*",B.Ex,B.FY,B.Fu,B.F3,B.Ff,"to first word*","*Preview figure \u2014 final numbers land with the public release.","For everyone","Made for the way *you* think.",B.EI,"Live preview","Ask it something *hard.*","Pick a prompt and watch Sonot work. This is a scripted preview \u2014 the real thing lives in the app.","Preview","thinking\u2026",B.FL,B.HD,B.FN,B.EN,"Get *Sonot.*","Free to start. Yours in under a minute.",B.Fi,"v1.0 \u2014 preview",B.Js,"Sonot for {os} is almost here. Downloads open soon.","Made with obsession by","Replay film","\xa9 2026 Sonot. All rights reserved.","PT"],t.BV)
